description.p:
SNMP and logs overhaul, TLS transport. Async SNMP poller with typed
        interface models, rate derivation and a durable trap/inform pipeline;
        syslog TLS listener, file tailing, durable log history with search;
        an append-only events class; TLS/mTLS client support for connecting
        to a certificate-protected zenoh router. The zblob and zenkey crates
        graduated to their own repositories.
